-- rejected.42 -- a file that is MEANT to be refused.
--
-- It exists so that the error message in QMANUAL.md section 5.2 can be
-- reproduced.  `copy` is a 42 primitive that Q42 does not have, and loading
-- this file says why:
--
--   42q rejected bad "|0>"
--
-- If it ever loads successfully, something has gone wrong.

def bad = copy
